    "regime_notes": "Positive in 2022-23 and 2025-26, negative in 2020-21, 2024, and 2027-30; full-history gates pass but the factor is regime-sensitive and should be direction/regime controlled by the consumer.",
    "universe": "15 tradable benchmark instruments; average cross-section 14.808; dates with at least 8 valid instruments retained",
